--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Demonstration documents
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The PDFs in demo_docs/ are synthetic and generated for demonstration purposes
(see generate_pdfs.py). They contain no real health data and have no clinical
value.

The official recommendations used in the demo (HAS, SFMU) are NOT redistributed
in this repository. They remain the property of their publishers and can be
downloaded from the source: see demo_docs_officiels/SOURCES.md and
scripts/fetch_demo_docs.sh.

